2. Fix Windows DNS Issue
Windows sometimes cannot resolve mshome.net, especially in a local development environment.

🔹 Solution: Add Entry to Hosts File
Open Notepad as Administrator.
Open the file:
makefile

C:\Windows\System32\drivers\etc\hosts
Add this line at the end:

127.0.0.1   DESKTOP-N7FVPDL.mshome.net
Save the file and restart your services.
